From: SmartWRT
Subject: [PATCH] hostapd: experimental MT7986 adjacent zero-wait DFS control

Keep the generic dedicated background-radar flow unchanged. The opt-in
adjacent mode starts off-channel CAC only for the proven 36/80 -> 52/80
pair, switches by CSA after CAC, and avoids selecting an uncleared DFS
channel for immediate radar recovery. It never overrides NOP.

This is a debug-router prototype, not RF or ETSI certification.
---
